  "description": "AL symbol restore and config-driven multi-project build tool for Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central.\n      Declarative alwasp.json config with apps/tests inventory, profiles, and targets.\n      Deterministic symbol restore from NuGet feeds with incremental manifest caching.",
