  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0 establishes AlWasp Free as the thin host for the binding 0.1.0-preview.14 Free command\n      surface while adding the release's shared build improvements: multi-repository change\n      detection, direct-change-aware internal dependency versioning, informational package\n      comparison, and reliable compiler output/tool process handling. Pro-only Analysis,\n      Translations, Automation, and Licensing assemblies are not shipped in this package.\n      FREE-BASELINE.md and CHANGELOG.md contain the complete details.",
